#, no-c-format
#~ msgid ""
#~ "4:3 is the arcade monitor's shape (the default).\n"
#~ "Square pixels shows the raw 496x384 (slightly narrow).\n"
#~ "16:9 (experimental) draws the 3D wider, with the 2D in the middle.\n"
#~ "Stretch fills the whole window.\n"
#~ "GPU renderers only. Applies live."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "4:3 er formen på arkademonitoren (standard).\n"
#~ "Kvadratiske piksler viser rå 496x384 (litt smalt).\n"
#~ "16:9 (eksperimentelt) tegner 3D bredere, med 2D i midten.\n"
#~ "Strekk fyller hele vinduet.\n"
#~ "Kun GPU-renderere. Gjelder umiddelbart."

