#, no-c-format
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Wheel force on driving games: centring and cornering\n"
#~ "forces decoded from the game's own drive-board commands,\n"
#~ "plus an impact jolt when you hit something."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Rattkraft i bilspill: sentrerings- og svingkrefter\n"
#~ "dekodet fra spillets egne drivkortkommandoer,\n"
#~ "pluss et støt når du treffer noe."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid ""
#~ "A gain on every force of the drive board. At 100 %, the\n"
#~ "board's full power (63) gives the wheel's full force, every\n"
#~ "force in proportion. 200 % doubles every force: those above\n"
#~ "half the board's power (32, Sega Rally's strongest torque)\n"
#~ "then saturate."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "En forsterkning av alle drivkortets krefter. Ved 100 % gir\n"
#~ "kortets fulle effekt (63) rattets fulle kraft, hver kraft i\n"
#~ "forhold. 200 % dobler hver kraft: de over halvparten av\n"
#~ "kortets effekt (32, Sega Rallys sterkeste moment) går da i\n"
#~ "metning."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid ""
#~ "The centring spring of the Sega Rally Championship and\n"
#~ "Daytona USA cabinets: very light, it brings the wheel\n"
#~ "back and is barely felt when held against. A share of\n"
#~ "the resistance above. The other games' cabinets drive\n"
#~ "the wheel with no spring, and ignore this setting."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Sentreringsfjæren i Sega Rally Championship- og Daytona\n"
#~ "USA-maskinene: svært lett, den fører rattet tilbake og\n"
#~ "kjennes knapt når man holder imot. En andel av motstanden\n"
#~ "ovenfor. De andre spillenes maskiner driver rattet uten\n"
#~ "fjær og ignorerer denne innstillingen."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid ""
#~ "The motor strength set on the drive board's DIP switches,\n"
#~ "the switches ON counted in binary: 0 = all OFF.\n"
#~ "Sega Rally: switches 1-3, 0 to 7 added to every torque.\n"
#~ "Daytona USA: switches 1-3, 4 times that.\n"
#~ "Indy 500, Touring Car, Over Rev, Super GT 24h:\n"
#~ "switches 1-1 to 1-3, 0 to 7 added to every force."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Motorstyrken satt med drivkortets DIP-brytere, bryterne på\n"
#~ "ON telt binært: 0 = alle OFF. Sega Rally:\n"
#~ "bryter 1-3, 0 til 7 lagt til hvert moment. Daytona USA:\n"
#~ "bryter 1-3, 4 ganger det. Indy 500, Touring Car, Over Rev,\n"
#~ "Super GT 24h: bryter 1-1 til 1-3, 0 til 7 lagt til hver\n"
#~ "kraft."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid ""
#~ "For a wheel whose driver pushes the wrong way: it pulls\n"
#~ "away from the centre instead of bringing it back, and\n"
#~ "the game's forces go the opposite way."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "For et ratt der driveren skyver feil vei: det trekker\n"
#~ "bort fra midten i stedet for å føre det tilbake,\n"
#~ "og spillets krefter går motsatt vei."

